{
  "info": {
    "name": "Pinaka Commerce Hub - Merchants, Stores and Subscriptions",
    "description": "24 requests from the API examples. Local merchant service runs on port 3003. Edit collection variables before sending. POST creates records, PUT/PATCH updates them, and DELETE permanently removes them. Do not run the whole collection against existing data: cancellation/deletion requests are included. Merchant onboarding creates an initial subscription automatically; subscriptionMerchantId must identify an existing merchant without a subscription for the subscription POST test. Master plans and merchant subscriptions are separate APIs; current onboarding uses its existing plan defaults. No requests were sent while generating this collection.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
